;; The waterfall climb from Bill's jungle camp back up into 7-3 (campaign only, docs/HEROES.md),
;; in the style of Contra's third stage: one screen wide, two screens tall (a free camera follows
;; the climb). The player steps out of the camp's cave onto the pool's floor at the bottom left.
;; Rock ledges (`T`, three tiles up and one tile apart: every hero's jump makes it, small Mario's
;; and Simon's stiff one too) climb right beside the waterfall to a jungle vine on the right wall,
;; and from its top more ledges climb left to a vine on the left wall that leads off the top of the
;; screen: up into 7-3 at column 199, climbing out of the jungle onto the tree platform past the
;; exploding bridge (a climb arrival). No ledge hangs over another's take-off (each vine rises nine
;; rows), the floor catches every fall and the walls close both sides, so nobody gets stuck. The
;; clock runs on (time: inherit). Theme `contra-falls` (B3's art: the falling water slides down).

[tiles]
;; Rows 0-1 stay clear under the HUD at the top of the climb.
